<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 4.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 4.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day  and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close  was 2745.06, 52.94 points or 1.89 percent lower than Tuesday's close.</p>
